# VibeEdit Windows port — files that are local runtime state, never
# committed. Added round 22 (the repo previously had no .gitignore,
# so fresh checkouts showed .venv/, __pycache__/ and projects/ as
# untracked). None of these paths is tracked, so adding this file
# changes no tracked file's status.
.venv/
__pycache__/
projects/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.vibeedit-save.tmp
